1
00:00:00,297 --> 00:00:01,530
Deadline tinggal satu jam!

2
00:00:01,918 --> 00:00:03,650
Dan aplikasi desain gue malah...

3
00:00:03,812 --> 00:00:04,700
NGE-FREEZE?!

4
00:00:04,991 --> 00:00:06,600
HAH?! SERIUS SEKARANG?!

5
00:00:06,866 --> 00:00:07,860
Jam sepuluh malam.

6
00:00:08,044 --> 00:00:09,690
Klien minta file
sebelum jam sebelas.

7
00:00:09,901 --> 00:00:11,000
Gue klik sekali...

8
00:00:11,126 --> 00:00:12,040
dua kali...

9
00:00:12,428 --> 00:00:13,800
Komputernya malah diem.

10
00:00:14,074 --> 00:00:15,190
Kayak lagi ngambek!

11
00:00:15,635 --> 00:00:16,570
Masalahnya...

12
00:00:16,797 --> 00:00:18,480
perubahan terakhir
belum gue simpan.

13
00:00:18,826 --> 00:00:21,040
Waduh! Jangan sampai
ngulang dari awal!

14
00:00:21,242 --> 00:00:23,080
Gue coba buka lagi aplikasinya,

15
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:24,910
sambil berharap
file gue masih aman.

16
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,710
Dan ternyata...

17
00:00:26,998 --> 00:00:28,650
ADA FILE AUTO RECOVERY!

18
00:00:28,799 --> 00:00:31,280
Alhamdulillah... masih selamat!

19
00:00:31,638 --> 00:00:33,120
Tapi waktunya makin mepet.

20
00:00:33,319 --> 00:00:35,930
Gue langsung cek informasi promo,
rapihin layout,

21
00:00:35,977 --> 00:00:38,400
pastiin ukuran desain,
terus ekspor filenya.

22
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:40,640
Nggak ada waktu buat
utak-atik detail kecil!

23
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:41,510
Upload...

24
00:00:41,636 --> 00:00:42,260
loading...

25
00:00:42,508 --> 00:00:43,260
TERKIRIM!

26
00:00:43,457 --> 00:00:45,310
Huft... akhirnya.

27
00:00:45,342 --> 00:00:46,680
Sebelum jam sebelas!

28
00:00:46,751 --> 00:00:48,430
Gue kira udah bisa istirahat.

29
00:00:48,587 --> 00:00:50,170
Eh... besok paginya,

30
00:00:50,267 --> 00:00:51,300
klien nge-chat lagi.

31
00:00:51,504 --> 00:00:52,700
Desainnya diterima...

32
00:00:52,970 --> 00:00:54,070
atau revisi lagi?

33
00:00:54,234 --> 00:00:56,500
Jawabannya di episode tujuh.
